(collections-b, batch A (evening) - docs/ledger/collections-b.md rows
 LST2-15, LST2-16, LST2-17, LST2-18, LST2-19, LST2-20, LST2-21, LST2-22,
 LST2-23, LST2-24.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself - the
 same convention tests/300_gen_buffers_a.vox uses. Each leaf is also
 emitted nested at least once, since 'gen join lines' renders a nested
 body (comma-joined) differently from a top-level one (period-joined)
 and that difference is exactly what a leaf's own gate has to prove
 survives rendering, not just "the idea" of the leaf (PROCEDURE.md 6a).

 The name allocator is 'gen buffer name'/'gen buffer reference'/'gen
 buffer property'/'gen buffer companion' from gen_buffers.vox - reused
 rather than re-spent, per tonight's brief.)

Print "--- LST2-15/16/17/18/19/23: list properties, a three-element list ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list length and ends' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list length and ends' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a single-element list (first, last and element 1 all agree) ---".
'rng seed' of 182.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list length and ends' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- LST2-20: an empty list - length/size/empty without a flag, first/last with one ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list empty properties' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list empty properties' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- LST2-21/22: element 1, plus a literal index at another position ---".
'rng seed' of 6.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list element index' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- LST2-21/24: element 1, plus a variable-index read ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list element index' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf list element index' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.
